  firstInspection:
  - I can feel my hands again. They're shaking. That's okay. That means they're mine.
  - I'm going to call my sister. I don't know what I'll say. Maybe I'll just let
    her laugh at me.
  repeatInspection:
  - Summer rain. I forgot it had a smell.
