  inspectionId: ParkMap
  firstInspection:
  - A park map. YOU ARE HERE, it says, with an arrow pointing at a lonely dot.
  - 'Someone scratched a note into the plastic: <color=#B9A7FF>''They gave up in
    order. Light their lamps in the same order, and maybe they''ll remember.''</color>'
  repeatInspection:
  - '''They gave up in order.'' First, then, last.'
